{
  "$schema": "https://json.schemastore.org/claude-code-settings.json",
  "_comment": [
    "Shared project settings for cont_exchange_v2.0 — committed to repo.",
    "Personal/per-user allow lists belong in .claude/settings.local.json",
    "(which is gitignored).",
    "",
    "What this file does:",
    "  - permissions.deny: blocks destructive operations regardless of",
    "    individual allow rules. Cannot be overridden by settings.local.json.",
    "  - hooks.UserPromptSubmit: runs tools/auto-archive-attachments.py BEFORE",
    "    each user prompt is shown to the assistant; parses <document> blocks",
    "    and stores each attachment under incoming-docs/YYYY-MM-DD-<slug>-",
    "    <sha8>.md (dedup by SHA1). Documented in CLAUDE.md §0a 'Auto-archive",
    "    of chat attachments'. Registered here (not in settings.local.json)",
    "    per AUDIT-001 T-AUDIT-004 so every developer gets archiving out of",
    "    the box.",
    "  - hooks.PostToolUse: runs scripts/hooks/post_edit_hint.sh after every",
    "    Edit/Write to surface project-specific reminders (rebuild, init.sql",
    "    semantics, bundle hash verification, etc).",
    "",
    "  Encodes the lessons of PR-F02-001..016 + PR-AUDIT-004 — every footgun",
    "  we hit becomes a hook reminder or a deny rule."
  ],
  "permissions": {
    "deny": [
      "Bash(rm -rf /*)",
      "Bash(rm -rf ~/*)",
      "Bash(rm -rf $HOME/*)",
      "Bash(git reset --hard *)",
      "Bash(git push --force *)",
      "Bash(git push --force-with-lease main*)",
      "Bash(git push *origin main *)",
      "Bash(git branch -D main)",
      "Bash(git branch -D sync/dev-import)",
      "Bash(docker compose down -v*)",
      "Bash(docker volume rm *)",
      "Bash(docker volume prune*)",
      "Bash(*DROP TABLE*)",
      "Bash(*DROP DATABASE*)",
      "Bash(*DROP SCHEMA*)",
      "Bash(*TRUNCATE TABLE flow_orders*)",
      "Bash(*TRUNCATE TABLE hedgeflows*)",
      "Bash(*TRUNCATE TABLE ledger_*)",
      "Bash(*--no-verify*)",
      "Bash(*--no-gpg-sign*)"
    ]
  },
  "hooks": {
    "UserPromptSubmit": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python3 \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/tools/auto-archive-attachments.py\""
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Edit|Write",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash scripts/hooks/post_edit_hint.sh"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
